    "title": "Golden Eagle Hockey Returns from Break to host the Jimmies - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kieran Lang ,\n16 hours ago Crookston, Minn. - The Golden Eagles are back following their 35 day break. In town this weekend is the University of Jamestown, who the Golden Eagles have a lot of experience playing against. This will be one of just two home weekends remaining for the Golden Eagles, with just four weekends remaining before Tournaments begin, which will start with the WCCHA Tournament in the beginning of February. But, that is quite a ways from this weekend, and the Golden Eagles have to handle some business before they start thinking about the tournaments. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
